{
  "file_id": "3583",
  "text_count": 193,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "scape looks different, so\nI don't know how to find the\nVillage of Beginnings...",
      "_offset": 100,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "I'm tired! I can't take another\nstep...",
      "_offset": 180,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Mimi is hungry, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 220,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Hang in there, tama! I'll be back\nwith some food, tama!",
      "_offset": 244,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Ah! No, no, I didn't mean to...",
      "_offset": 300,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "We know, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 332,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "But we'd like to do something\nuseful, tama! So wait for us,\ntama!",
      "_offset": 349,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "I'll go with you, too!",
      "_offset": 415,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Aren't they being a little *too*\nnice to me?",
      "_offset": 438,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "That's because they like you.",
      "_offset": 483,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Sorry for the wait, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 513,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Wow! You even found some cola! Aw,\nbut it's not cold...",
      "_offset": 541,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Let me borrow it. I'll chill it up\nfor you.",
      "_offset": 597,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Burn, burn, burn! And it's cooked.",
      "_offset": 641,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Not bad! You're pretty useful!",
      "_offset": 676,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "*zzzzzzzzzz*",
      "_offset": 707,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "You know, Jou... you don't have to\nbe a doctor if you don't want to.",
      "_offset": 720,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "But Dad said...",
      "_offset": 789,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "That's what Dad wants. But you\nneed to find your own path for\nyourself.",
      "_offset": 805,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "It was a dream...",
      "_offset": 877,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Ogremon?",
      "_offset": 895,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Yeah?",
      "_offset": 904,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "It's my turn.",
      "_offset": 910,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Really? Okay, take it.",
      "_offset": 924,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Find my own path... Is that what\nyou did, Yamato?",
      "_offset": 947,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "This is the Village of Beginnings.",
      "_offset": 997,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "So cruel...",
      "_offset": 1032,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "What's wrong, Jou?",
      "_offset": 1044,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "I just...",
      "_offset": 1063,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Yeah, that's it!",
      "_offset": 1073,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Hey, Jou!",
      "_offset": 1090,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Was that... the sound of a\nharmonica?",
      "_offset": 1100,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Let's go check it out!",
      "_offset": 1138,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "What?! It was you... I was so sure\nit was...",
      "_offset": 1161,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Now that the Village of Beginnings\nis like this, there's nothing left\nfor me to do...",
      "_offset": 1206,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "By the way, how are Takeru and\nPatamon doing?",
      "_offset": 1292,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Oh! They're doing fine.",
      "_offset": 1338,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "We're not really traveling\ntogether, though.",
      "_offset": 1362,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "I see... Good to hear!",
      "_offset": 1407,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Hey, why don't you come with us?",
      "_offset": 1430,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Huh?",
      "_offset": 1463,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "The village won't go back to\nnormal until we defeat the Dark\nMasters.",
      "_offset": 1468,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "We're looking for allies to help\nus!",
      "_offset": 1538,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Defeat the Dark Masters? Man, you\nguys think big!",
      "_offset": 1575,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "We're not just thinking about it!\nThe fight's already started!",
      "_offset": 1625,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Takeru and Patamon are fighting,\ntoo!",
      "_offset": 1688,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Well, I guess I can't just let\nPatamon one-up me!",
      "_offset": 1726,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "I'll come with you, then! You guys\nwon't be able to do anything by\nyourselves, anyway.",
      "_offset": 1776,
      "_length": 86,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Now *what* did ya just say?!",
      "_offset": 1863,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "By the way, about that\nharmonica...",
      "_offset": 1892,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "About that harmonica...",
      "_offset": 1928,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Oh, this? Someone dropped it on\nthe shore. I found it there.",
      "_offset": 1952,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Dropped? Let me see it for a\nsecond...\nYep, it's Yamato's.",
      "_offset": 2013,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "it's Yamato's.",
      "_offset": 2072,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Really? Then he must be around\nhere! But...",
      "_offset": 2087,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Now that you mention it, I saw a\nswan boat going off into the\nsea...",
      "_offset": 2131,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "I thought it was the Nightmare\nSoldiers doing something weird\nagain.",
      "_offset": 2200,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "A swan boat?",
      "_offset": 2269,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "No doubt about it, it's Yamato.\nListen, Mimi...",
      "_offset": 2282,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Now that we've gotten some more\nallies, Gomamon and I don't need\nto be here anymore, right?",
      "_offset": 2330,
      "_length": 91,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Huh? What do you mean? Are you\ngoing somewhere, Jou?",
      "_offset": 2422,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "I'm going after Yamato.",
      "_offset": 2475,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "But then we should all go\ntogether...",
      "_offset": 2499,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "No, Gomamon and I will go by\nourselves.",
      "_offset": 2537,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Why?",
      "_offset": 2577,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "We have to follow our own paths.",
      "_offset": 2582,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "You're taking the path of finding\nallies, Mimi. Taichi's group is \ntaking the path of fighting.",
      "_offset": 2615,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "No, no, I'm not going to let\nTaichi fight by himself. I want to\nfight, too!",
      "_offset": 2715,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "And I thought, \"But I'm not\nstrong, I'm only getting in the\nway...\"",
      "_offset": 2791,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Jou...",
      "_offset": 2859,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "But I'm pretty sure there's\nsomething that only I can do!",
      "_offset": 2866,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "I think that's the kind of thing\nYamato was thinking, too. So I'm\ngonna go after him!",
      "_offset": 2924,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Jou...",
      "_offset": 3010,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Let 'im go. He's tougher than he\nlooks!",
      "_offset": 3017,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Is it okay for me to come to a\nconclusion, just like that?",
      "_offset": 3057,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Of course it is!",
      "_offset": 3116,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Thanks, Gomamon!",
      "_offset": 3133,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Yamato, this cave creeps me out.\nLet's find a way out of here!",
      "_offset": 3150,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Yeah, you're right...",
      "_offset": 3213,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "I've always been saying that\nTakeru needs me, but the truth is \nthat I'm the one who needed him.",
      "_offset": 3235,
      "_length": 96,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Huh?",
      "_offset": 3332,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "If I got him to depend on me, then\nI'd have my life's purpose...",
      "_offset": 3337,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "That's why I always got mad at\nTaichi. I felt like he was taking\nhim away from me...",
      "_offset": 3402,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "What's wrong? Yamato...",
      "_offset": 3487,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "It's over for me. I can't just go\nback to being their friend.",
      "_offset": 3511,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Don't say that! All eight of us\nhave to work together if we wanna\nsave the world!",
      "_offset": 3573,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "They don't need me. Nothing would\nchange if I weren't there...",
      "_offset": 3655,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Yamato...",
      "_offset": 3718,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Ow! The heck was that?!",
      "_offset": 3728,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "There's only one of you in this\nworld, Yamato!",
      "_offset": 3752,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "What am *I* supposed to do if\nyou're not here?",
      "_offset": 3803,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "I spent all this time in this\nworld, waiting for you!",
      "_offset": 3850,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Gabumon...",
      "_offset": 3904,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Do you really want to be alone?\nBecause if you really, truly do,\nI'll leave.",
      "_offset": 3915,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "No, I don't want to be alone... I\nlied.",
      "_offset": 3992,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "I was just trying to feel cool...\nbut the truth is... I'm really\nlonely.",
      "_offset": 4032,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Yamato...",
      "_offset": 4105,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "I always thought, \"I shouldn't\ncry\"... But I really, really want\nto!",
      "_offset": 4115,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "I hate being alone...",
      "_offset": 4184,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "I'm here, right? I'm relying on\nyou...",
      "_offset": 4206,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "So you can rely on me, and we'll\nbe able to do more together!",
      "_offset": 4245,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "Gabumon... you're right, you're\nhere with me.",
      "_offset": 4307,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "I'm not alone...",
      "_offset": 4353,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Yamato...",
      "_offset": 4370,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "I've got friends... I've got\nTakeru, and my mom and dad...",
      "_offset": 4380,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Did the cave just... disappear?",
      "_offset": 4439,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Yamato, look!",
      "_offset": 4471,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "What's that?",
      "_offset": 4485,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "That thing was floating around\nyou. Didn't you notice?",
      "_offset": 4498,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "It was trying to get inside your\nheart.",
      "_offset": 4553,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "No, that's not it... the darkness\nin my lonely heart was attracting\nit.",
      "_offset": 4593,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "But it's different now!",
      "_offset": 4665,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "That's right!",
      "_offset": 4689,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "It's only gonna get tougher from\nhere on out, so I'm going to have\nto rely on you quite a bit.",
      "_offset": 4703,
      "_length": 94,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "No problem!",
